# Language

- **Git commit messages**: write in English (imperative mood, concise subject line).
- **Code comments, doc comments (`///`), and user-facing developer strings** in source: English only.
- UI copy for end users may stay English for this project unless product requirements specify otherwise.

The maintainer may communicate in Spanish; repository artifacts stay English for collaborators.
